  "date": "2026-11-05",
  "draft_py": "# Mu Yanling, Sky Dancer (M20). \"[+2]: Until your next turn, up to one target creature gets -2/-0\n# and loses flying.\" Garruk, Unleashed's loyalty +1 shape (B5c-loyalty-pt-trample: a Seq of\n# MODIFY_PT and a keyword change over one \"up to one target creature\" selector) with Rookie\n# Mistake's \"-2/-0\" (DECREASE 2 / DECREASE 0), Soul Sear's LOSE_ABILITY for \"loses flying\", and\n# DurationUntilNextTurn for \"until your next turn\" on both steps. The compiled [-3] and [-8] and\n# the planeswalker carrier are kept, in printed order after the [+2].\ntarget = Selector(\n    count=QAtMost(n=1),\n    mode=SelectorMode.TARGET,\n    filter=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n)\nplus_two = ActivatedAbility(\n    cost=Cost(parts=(CostLoyalty(delta=2),)),\n    effect=Seq(\n        steps=(\n            A(Verb.MODIFY_PT, {\n                'duration': DurationUntilNextTurn(),\n                'power': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.DECREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=2)),\n                'target': target,\n                'toughness': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.DECREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=0)),\n            }),\n            A(Verb.LOSE_ABILITY, {\n                'ability': KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.FLYING),\n                'duration': DurationUntilNextTurn(),\n                'target': target,\n            }),\n        ),\n    ),\n)\nabilities = [plus_two, *compiled]\n",
  "clauses": [
   {
    "clause": "[+2]: Until your next turn, up to one target creature gets -2/-0 and loses flying.",
    "ir": "abilities[0]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "[−3]: Create a 4/4 blue Elemental Bird creature token with flying.",
    "ir": "abilities[1]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "[−8]: You get an emblem with \"Islands you control have '{T}: Draw a card.'\"",
    "ir": "abilities[2]"
   }
  ],
  "g0_warnings": [],
  "notes": "G1 starts at loyalty 2, so only the +2 is exercised there. Packs in /tmp/claude-1000/-home-sune/2e18468a-eed7-47b5-a69b-d15b1f5fd0e8/scratchpad/round_m20/mapped/m0/mu_yanling: pack_plus_two_persists.json / pack_plus_two_ends.json (lasts through the opponent's turn, ends at your next turn), pack_minus_three.json (4/4 flying Bird). WEAKER THAN PRINTED, two engine/pool issues: (1) B-50 is live: pack_plus_two_survives_mu_leaving.json fails, because the 'loses flying' layer expires when Mu Yanling leaves the battlefield (the -2/-0 stays); (2) the -8's emblem is empty because the card 'Mu Yanling, Sky Dancer Emblem' is unmapped (its sentence is UNPARSED); pack_minus_eight_emblem.json fails until that emblem card has a record."
